### 1. Product 대량 Batch Insert 성능 테스트 (1,000건)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/batch?count=1000
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Product JSONB 필드 검색 (brand = Apple)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search/jsonb?key=brand&value=Apple
Accept: application/json

### 3. Product Native Array (text[]) 검색 (tag = apple)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search/tag?tag=apple
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. JobTask 테스트 데이터 30개 생성 (Seed)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/seed?count=30
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. JobTask 선점 (Worker-1) - SKIP LOCKED 동작 확인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/claim?workerName=Worker-1
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. JobTask 선점 (Worker-2) - 동시 호출 시 다른 task_id 획득
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/claim?workerName=Worker-2
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. JobTask 전체 상태 요약 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/status
Accept: application/json
